E. XLM-R Baseline
We add another off-the-shelf baseline by fine-tuning XLM-RBASE, which is a multilingual RoBERTa model introduced by Conneau et al. (2020), in the task of multitask dependency parsing and POS and morphological features tagging. This model performs better than both variants of mBERT as well as the WikiBERT model but underperforms our two monolingual models, gaBERT and gaELECTRA.
